        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2) Employees who are currently laid off and who have recall rights in accordance with Article 9 of the Labor Agreement to job titles included in the contract expiring November 24, 1990 and in subsequent labor agreements shall have recall rights to any equivalent new job titles established.",
